# VLESS Account Management Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = your_api_key_here

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create VLESS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vless/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvless",
  "exp": "30",
  "quota": "10GB",
  "ip_quota": "5"
}

### Check VLESS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vless/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvless"
}

### Renew VLESS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vless/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvless",
  "exp": "15"
}

### Delete VLESS Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vless/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvless"
}

### Create VLESS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvless2",
  "exp": "30",
  "quota": "10GB",
  "ip_quota": "5",
  "account_type": "vless"
}

### Check VLESS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvless2",
  "account_type": "vless"
}

### Renew VLESS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvless2",
  "exp": "15",
  "account_type": "vless"
}

### Delete VLESS Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testvless2",
  "account_type": "vless"
}